 also i think the fact that  like  you see these two friends who were able  to say that they love each other  in that moment and i think there's  something really meaningful to that that  the show was like we can show platonic  love you know between these two guys in  the sense that you know it really hits  home so um  well i think then you know there are all  different kinds of flavors of love and i  think  um men sometimes struggle to kind of  talk about that  um  and yeah i think kind of i mean i  personally i definitely have kind of  like older people like kind of guys in  my life who i kind of admired and  definitely had this kind of fraternal  love towards  and i felt that from them too and i  think kind of like that's what me and  gayson kind of wanted to kind of  uh convey  with our kind of um storyline really so  um  yeah i'm glad that that could actually  come across i know that you've gone on  record as saying that you would love to  come back for season five but that was  also before we found out about a certain  fate you know for eddie um but even with  that in mind i feel like there still  could be some possibility so  provided you got the call would you be  would you be in for showing up for one  more season  yeah i mean i don't know how they do it  but yeah i'd love to come back um  it feels like his  his face might be pretty um  yeah  it speaks for itself i think um but uh  if there was a world in which i don't  know i could kind of be  yeah a fly on the wall or something i  don't know um  i think  my suspicion is that they've got enough  characters to kind of grapple with at  the moment so um i think  they might have got um what they needed  out of eddie but um it was a pleasure to  be here you know even if it was only for  one season  i mean i personally would make a pitch  for like eddie as dustin's force ghost  or something like i was thinking  something like that it's like become his  conscience or something yeah definitely  um  but on that note i am actually all out  of time thank you so much for for your  time um chatting with me about the show  today and it's it's been great to watch  you this season so look forward to maybe  potentially force ghost uh eddie we'll  see  see let's see please meet connie thank  you  you
 

